<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1KOL</book>
  <para style="h">1 Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli bisu Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Koliito</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli asuundi libundu la Koliito mu mudyenge wa myole mu isalu. Koliito li mumosi mu misyenge miminene mya hu toto a Bangeleke. Musyenge wu li na busina mu tooni a bu nde aba mapfula ma makuumbi. Ka huuna, hwaba na baviha na biyaha bi byakadya mu isalu hya bo hya kele tsuhu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu tangu mo yiina, bisu Koliito baakaduukala bisambilili bi bangoyi. Baatu ba baaba mu libundu la Bamukristo mu musyenge a Koliito, fulafula ba baamata mu binzanzambi bya pila mu pila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli miiyaka maluumbi ma libundu la Koliito (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:11">1.11</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 7:1">7.1</ref></char>). Ka Bamukristo bali mu udyengele mitswe mu misamu mi milahi mi mili mu uvyoho, na bo bali na byuhu bi byavele na mamvutu. Ni mu buuna Pahuli hasonihi muhanda mo wunuuwu, mu ufutala mamvutu mu byuhu mo biina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu bitsudu mo biniibi <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1-4">1–4</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu uyambila mu ma mamiitala Bamukristo ba hu Koliito, na ma mamiitala ba baalongisi bo Musamu wu Mubwe. Ka hu li na kele na makabu hutso libundu la Koliito. Pasi muutu tondi uteleme ŋa mbisa mulongisi a nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-13">1.10-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:6">4.6</ref></char>). Ka Pahuli li silasa ti hya tsoongo hyuva, ni ndongisili mo yiniiyi: Kristo, iluumbi hya Nzambi, wu baakomini ŋa muti a kuruwa mu tooni a bisu. <char style="em">Mambu mo maniima maalutahala tsikihili yi imuutu</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:18-2:15">1.18–2.15</ref></char>). Biluumbi bya Yisu Kristo bili byosi basalili ba Nzambi ba bafwana usala mu itwadi (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 3">3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Umata<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-11:16">5.1–11.16</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu uva mvutu mu ma mamiitala mambu ma libundu ali mu ubwana na mo pasi ilumbu na uleele <char style="em">buni Bamukristo bali baatu ba nga bunyanga</char> (utala buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9">9</ref></char>). Uba mukristo na ubweba na ndyatili yi mbi, libundu utwala mu usilasa maana ve (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">5.6</ref></char>). Pahuli li mu ufutala mvutu mu byuhu bya bisu Koliito mu musamu makwele (buli la 7), mu ma mamiitala bipfu bi binzanzambi (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 8-10">8–10</ref></char>). Mu misamu mo miina myosi nde li mu uvondo huli bamukristo mu usaha libwe la bana na ukiinza kaka bana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 11:17-14:40">11.17–14.40</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu ulongese mu ngu musamu wu li mu utala ndyatili baatu mutso libundu. Nde li mu umweese matooni ma mali mu ubehe makabu. Pahuli li mu umweese ma mali mu ubehe <char style="em">itwadi mu libundu</char>. Pasi ibadi hya nyutu hili na tsoongo. Mu mbuli, Bamukristo bali we nyutu. Pasi ibadi hya nyutu hili na tsoongo mu linyutu loosi. Libundu laatsahala nga yulu litondo (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 13">13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15">15</ref></char> lili mu yibwala bisu moonyi ti Nzambi asuula Yisu mu babaakwa, na ti<char style="em">na ilumbu hi, babaakwa buusuuha</char> kaka. Tso Bamukristo basiidi hiitu mu maana, idiingu na imiinu hya bo bili na lisuunga.</para>
  <para style="ip">We mihanda mikima, wunuuwu li mu usuka mu manzabisili na mu mabwehe (Buli la<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16">16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bisu Koliito a bali Bamukristo ba baasupaha ve. Ka Pahuli li mu ufutala matondo mu tooni a bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:4-9">1.4-9</ref></char>). Mbuli, mapasi na bipiha bili mutso idiingu hya pasi libundu. Tso hu li buuna, Nzambi li mu uhwada mu uvaanga mabwe huli baatu, na uteele Bamukristo mu uhwada mu mbiili yi bungetetee.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Ni me Pahuli, wu Nzambi hateele mu uba iluumbi hya Kristo Yisu, mu litondo la Nzambi. Itwadi na mwana a ngu Sosetene, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />me ndi mu utsonehe huli libundu la Nzambi la hu musyenge a Koliito<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1-11">Mav 18.1-11</ref></char></note>, huli ba baatsyemese mu Yisu Kristo. Nzambi ateele bo mu uba baatu ba nde bangidi, na huli boosi pasi tsyelo yi bo bali, ba bali mu usambila Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, Pfumu a bo na wa bisu kaka.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi li mu uva bisu mabwe mu Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Tangu yoosi, me umbaapfutala matondo huli Nzambi mu tooni a benu, mu hyese hi nde hasa benu ba laakangama mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ni mbuli, mu Kristo benu laamiiyaka busina bwosi: bwa mambu na bwa nzaabili. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Bisu laalongese benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo, bunuubu, benu laamiikangama mu nde na ngolo yoosi. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Ni mu buuna, bungodu tso bumosi a bwavele ŋa hati la benu ve, benu ba lili mu ukeele na hiitu hyoosi, tangu yi Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo humonehele. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nzambi ni wu uhwadisa benu natee hu tsukusu, mana bavelebaha dyambu li usyembe benu mu ilumbu hya nziili a Pfumu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nde mwakulu wu ateele benu mu uba itwadi na Mwana a nde Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu: nde li ngetetee mu malahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Pfu 7.9</ref></char></note> ma nde.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makabu hutso libundu la Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Baana ba ngu, me ndi mu uhwadisa benu, mu nduhi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, mu ubaayuhasana, mana makabu maveleba ŋa hati la benu. Baabaani itwadi mu uba tsimi mosi na mutima mumosi.<verse eid="1CO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Eye, baana ba ngu a me, baatu ba nzo a Kolowe, baayabisa me ti iboho hili ŋa hati la benu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Me tondi uleele bunuubu: pasi muutu mu benu li na tsuhili mo yiniiyi. Mumosi ti: «Me, me wa Pahuli me ndi». Mukima ti: «Me wa Apoloosi». Mukima kaka ti: «Me wa Peetelo» buuve, «Me wa Kristo!» <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Benu lili mu utsima ti utwala ukaba Kristo? Pahuli ni wu akwidi ŋa kuruwa mu tooni a benu? Buuve, benu kaahu mu nduhi a Pahuli baatondihi?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Matondo huli Nzambi, bu me aveletondehe tso mumosi ŋa hati la benu, vengo Krisipusi na Ngayusi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Krisipusi na Ngayusi </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Mav 18.8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19.29</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Ni mu buuna, muutu tso mumosi a hutwala uleele ve ti, baatondehe nde mu nduhi a me. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Eye! Kaahu, me ambwetondehe kaka bisu nzo a Setefano. Me tsimi ti me a haabwetondehe muutu mukima ve. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Mu tooni ati, Kristo a haatsindaha me mu utondehe ve. Ka nde atsindaha me mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, hwavele usalila bitoyili bya tsiki yi imuutu, mana lipfu la Kristo ŋa muti livelefwa matwala.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsiki a baatu ba tsi yili ladi huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Mu mbuli, ulongese mu tsangu yi lipfu la Yisu ŋa kuruwa, hu li ladi ŋa busu bwa baatu ba baamiidimbala. Ka mu bisu a benu ba lili mu nzila liyobolo: tsangu yi lipfu la Yisu ŋa muti yili matwala ma Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele, bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">«Me tsa tsala tsikihili a banga tsiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">na me tsa mbuma buyedi bwa banga buyedi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Esa 29.14</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Banga tsiki huni bali? Babaayiha huni bali? Banga bileedi huni bali? Ka Nzambi amweese ti tsikihili a tsi mo yiniiyi yili ladi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:25">Esa 44.25</ref></char></note>!<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Mu mbuli, mu tsiki a nde, Nzambi amiisa ti baatu ba tsi baveletwala uyaaba nde mu tsiki a bo mwakulu. Ni mu buuna, nde haamiivolo kesili yi uyobolo ba bali mu usa imiinu, mu nzila a ndongisili yi yili mu umonehele we ladi. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Bayudaayo bali mu uvondo biliimbu bya kimuhili, na Bangeleke bali mu usaha mambu ma tsiki. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ka bisu, bisu uyabisa baatu ti Kristo ni wu akwa ŋa kuruwa. Nzabisili mo yiina, ni baku lilinene ŋa busu bu Bayudaayo na lo lili ladi huli bangoyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Ka huli ba Nzambi haateele, tso huli Bayudaayo buuve Bangeleke, Kristo ni matwala na tsiki a Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Mu tooni ati, ladi la Nzambi laalutahala tsiki a baatu, na ukolo hwa Nzambi hwalutahala pinyu a baatu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsiki a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Baana ba ngu, tsimaani buni benu laaba ŋa Nzambi haateeli benu. Mu talili yi imuutu, ŋa hati la benu, banga tsiki ndulu hoole bali, banga lituma ndulu hoole bali, ba bali mu bibaandu bi byamonehele ndulu hoole bali. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ka Nzambi asoolo bi baatu bubaamono ti ladi, mu ukwisa banga tsiki tsonyi. Na nde asoolo bi baatu bubaamono ti byakolo, mu ukwisa banga a pinyu tsonyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nzambi asoolo bi baatu ba tsi bubaamono ti byakulamana, bi baarokolo, tso bi byavele na tsongo, mu udimbasa bi bo bali mu umono ti byafulala tsongo. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Nzambi haasa buuna, mana muutu tso mumosi a hasa nyeme ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ka ni mu tooni a Nzambi benu laapfuutana na Yisu Kristo. Nde ni tsiki yi yibaamata huli Nzambi. Ni nde ubaakuhasa bisu butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, wu ubaava bisu muswa mu uba moonyi mu Nzambi, na wu ubaayobolo bisu mu masumu ma bisu. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Ni mu buuna, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Tso muutu tondi usa nyeme, nyaha nde asa nyeme mu ma Pfumu haavaanga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Yel 9.23</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uta ibila mu Kristo wu baakomene ŋa kuruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Baana ba ngu a me, ŋa me anzidi huli benu hati a tsomi, mu uyabisa benu tswehi a Nzambi, me a haatsalili bitoyili bi binono, buuve nzaabili yi yamonehele ve. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Eye, ŋa me ambeedi ŋa hati la benu, me apoli kesili yi uyiha ndulu dyambu la Yisu Kristo: ni lipfu la nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Ni mu buuna, me anzamonehele huli benu muutu wu akolo, na ubaatsula likamba mu boomo. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Mambu ma ndongisili a me na nzabisili a me, a maaba bileedi bya tsiki yi imuutu ve. Ka ni matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi maamweesi benu ti ndongisili a me aba ya mbuli, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />mana imiinu hya benu hisiingama mu matwala ma Nzambi, ka a mu tsiki a baatu ve.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsiki a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ka bisu libaalongese tsiki huli ba baakula mu imiinu. Tsiki mo a yili ya baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi ve, a tso bapfumu ba tsi ba buunyambaana. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Naana, bisu lili mu uyabisa tsiki a tswehi a Nzambi, yi baatu baaveleyaaba. Nzambi avangimisi yo tswamina mbandili a tsi, mana bisu likoto hutso muyusu a nde. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Tsiki mo yiina, tso mumosi mu bapfumu ba tsi mo yiniiyi a hayaabi yo ve. Bo kini baayaabi yo, bo a baakikomene Pfumu nga muyusu ve. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ka, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">«Li pasi muutu havelemono tso uveleyuha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">li pasi muutu haveletsima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Nzambi avangimasa lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">mu tooni a baatu ba bubaatondo nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:3">Esa 64.3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:15">Esa 52.15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ka, ni huli bisu, Nzambi hayabisa tswehi mo yiniiyi mu Livupu la Ngidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Mu mbuli, Livupu la nde utwala utsikaha byosi, tso hu li matsimi ma Nzambi ma maasinzasweme. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ni mu buuna, mu ma matali muutu, ndulu livupu la muutu liyaabi matsimi ma muutu. Ni bumosi kaka, ndulu Livupu la Nzambi liyaabi matsimi ma Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ka bisu, bisu a laayaka livupu la tsi mo yiniiyi ve. Bisu laayaka Livupu li libaamata huli Nzambi, mana bisu litsikaha bungodu bu Nzambi haava bisu. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Na bisu, a na bitoyili bya tsiki yi imuutu bisu libaalongese bungodu mo buuna ve, ka mu ndongisili yi Livupu la Nzambi. Ni buuna, bisu lili mu ubiindula mamali mu utala Livupu, huli baatu ba bali mu udyata mu Livupu.<verse eid="1CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Ka woosi wu li mu uhwada ndulu mu imuutu, utwala uyaka bisiha bi Livupu la Nzambi ve: mu nde byo bili ladi. Nde utwala utsikaha byo ve. Mu tooni ati, ni mu Livupu la Nzambi buutwala utsikaha byo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Woosi wu li na Livupu la Nzambi utwala utsiha byosi. Ka baatu bakima utwala utsikaha mya muutu nga Livupu la Nzambi ve. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Mu mbuli baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">«Na ayaabi matsimi ma Pfumu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Na atwali uva nde mandoongi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Esa 40.13</ref></char></note>?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ka uto ti bisu, bisu lili na matsimi ma Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bungebe bu libundu la Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Mu me, baana ba ngu, me a hatwali utoyo na benu we huli baatu ba bali na Livupu la Nzambi ve. Ka, me miitoyo na benu we wu li mu utoyo na baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Mu tangu mo yiina, me atoyi na benu we bu babaatoyo huli bikenyi mu imiinu mu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Me apiidi benu mabeelo, ka a byudya bi binono ve, mu tooni ati, benu a laakiikunda byo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Heb 5.12-13</ref> </char></note>. Na tso buunuubu, benu a luutwala byo ve. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Mu tooni ati, mbiili a benu yi kini we ya baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Bu nyengi yili ŋa hati la benu, mitsotso, benu lili mu umweese ti benu li kini baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Ndyatili a benu yili yi imuutu. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Ŋa mumosi mu benu ali mu uleele ti: «Me wa Pahuli, me ndi!» Na mukima ti: «Me wa Apoloso, me ndi!» Buuna, benu lili mu udyata we baatu ba baaveleyaba Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Homo ati, Apoloso na ali? Na Pahuli na ali? Bo baatu ba Nzambi hasalila mu ubita benu hu imiinu. Muutu muutu mu bisu li mu ukuhasa isalu hi Pfumu haava nde. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Me akuna, Apoloso anyanza mamba, ka Nzambi ni wu ubaakulasa. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Buuna, wu ubaakuna na wu ubaanyanza mamba a bali na tsongo ve, ka ni Nzambi li na tsongo. Mu tooni ati, ni nde ubaakulasa bi baakuna. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Wu ubaakuna na wu ubaanyanza mamba, bubaasala boosi mu Nzambi. Pasi muutu mu bo sa ayaka musyendo nde, we bu hu li isalu hya nde. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Mu tooni ati, bisu lili batsyengi ba Nzambi. Benu lili ngundu a Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Benu lili kaka tuungili a Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />We bu hu li bungodu bu Nzambi haava me, me atsa isalu we mutuungi manzo nga buyedi, na me atuunga bibeene. Bunuubu, muutu mukima uyatuunga ŋa yulu. Nyaha pasi muutu wu uya humbisa akele mu tuungili a nde. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Mu tooni ati, bibeene baamiikwasuusa: ni Yisu Kristo. Na a hu li na muutu wu ubwetuunga bikima ve. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Bamosi buusalila wolo, tso mbongo yi bitali, buuve mamanya ma talu, mu utuunga ŋa yulu bibeene mo biina. Bakima buusalila mabaya, tso biimbu buuve kuunza. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ka bungeele bu isalu hya pasi muutu sa buyabahana mu ilumbu hya tsundusu. Mu mbuli, ilumbu mo hiina sa himonehele mu mbaahu. Na mbaahu sa yitsiitsa isalu hya pasi muutu mu umweese tsalu a hyo. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Tso muutu tuungi nzo yi yili mu ukuunda mbaahu, nde sa abaha pfuta. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ka tso nzo yi nyengi mu mbaahu, mutuungi a nzo a huyaka pfuta ve. Uto ti ndemo mwakulu, nde sa ayoboho. Ka uyoboho hwa nde huuba we wu uvyohele mutso a ludi la mbaahu.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Benu laafwana uyaaba ti nyutu a benu yili mbuha ya ngidi ya Nzambi, na ti Livupu la Nzambi lili mu benu. <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu tsali mbuha ya ngidi ya Nzambi, Nzambi sa atsala nde wuuna. Mu tooni ati, mbuha yi Nzambi hatsahala yili ya ngidi, na mbuha mo yiina ni benu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Muutu a apfuta nde mwakulu ve: tso mumosi mu benu li mu utsima ti nde nga tsiki mu misamu mya tsi mo yiniiyi, nyaha nde amaakituha «nga ladi», mana nde akituha «nga tsiki» ya mbuli a mbuli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Mu tooni ati, tsiki a tsi mo yiniiyi, yili ladi ŋa miisu ma Nzambi. Ni mu buuna Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Nzambi ubaabaha bapuni mu mweto a soho la bo mwakulu.» <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Mo mabaabweleele: «Pfumu yaabi matsimi ma banga tsiki, nde yaabi ti mo a mali na tsongo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Mkg 94.11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yob 5.13</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Ni mu buuna, a lisa nyeme mu tooni a baatu ve. Mu tooni ati, bisiha byosi bili bya benu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Pahuli, Apoloso buuve Peetelo, baatu ba tsi, moonyi buuve lipfu, loloyi buuve ngwali: byosi bili bya benu. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Ka benu, benu lili ba Kristo na Kristo li wu a Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ni mu buuna, benu laafwana ubaayibuhala moonyi ti bisu lili basalili ba Kristo, ba bali na mupfuna mu uyabisa matswehi ma Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ka dyambu li bubaavondo huli musalili, ni mu uba bangetetee. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Mu me, a hu li musamu tso benu litsundisi me ve, buuve banzonzi ba tsi. Mutima a me kaka a hali mu utsundasa me ve, bu nde havele mangoongo. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mu mbuli, me a handi na dyambu li mutima a me husyembe me ve. Ka buuna a buli mu umweese ve ti, me wu avelesa dyambu lilibi ŋa busu bwa Pfumu. Mutsundisi a me ni Pfumu. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ni mu buuna, a litsundasa ve, tswamina tangu yi baakese yito. Kelaani ti Pfumu amayaafutaha. Nde sa ayalusa byosi bi bili mu piipidi, na nde sa amweese makani ma mali mutso mitima mya baatu. Na Nzambi sa ava huli pasi muutu muyusu wu afwana na nde.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Baana ba ngu, me miitsonehele benu mu tooni a Apoloso na mu me mwakulu, mana benu litsikaha bubwe. Buuna, benu sa liyiha mu ifwaani hya bisu, mana benu litsikaha ngu musamu mo wunuuwu: «Hwafwana mu uba hutso mandilu we bu baasonehe.» Tso mumosi mu benu a haba na isaayi mu uvolo mileembe mya muutu mumosi na ubelele wuna. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Mu ki tooni we utsima ti we alutahala bana? Byosi bi we li na byo, a Nzambi ava we byo ve? Tso ni mbuli Nzambi ni wu ava we byo, ki tooni mu usa nyeme mu bi bamiiva we mu bungodu?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Benu laamiikwabaha byosi bi benu lili na byo nzala! Benu laaka bisina! Benu laamiibyala batumi hwavele a bisu. Ni buuna? Me na nzala ti benu ni liba hwa benu batumi, mana bisu libaatuma na benu itwadi. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ka me tsimi ti, Nzambi amiisuusa bisu biluumbi, ŋa mbuha ya tsyelele. Bisu baatu ba baamiiva kesilili lipfu, na bamiiyeholo bisu ŋa mbuha mikungi, ŋa miisu ma bapofi na ma baatu boosi. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Bisu lili banga ladi mu tooni a Kristo, ka benu lili na tsiki mu itwadi hya benu na Kristo. Bisu lili bimvwemvwengi, ka benu lili na mifudi; bisu lili ba baarokolo, ka benu lili baatu ba baayuusa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Natee mu taangu mo yiniiyi, bisu lili na nzala, na peyu, na pene, ba bali mu utete mapali, ba baavele a nzo yi utsahala. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Bisu lili mu umono pasi mu usala mu myoho mya bisu mu ubaha byudya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Mav 18.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:34">20.34</ref></char></note>. Ŋa baatu bali mu utuha bisu, bisu lili mu usyeme bo. Ŋa baatu bali mu utsuta bisu, bisu lili mu ukuunda. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Ŋa baatu bali mu uleele ma mabi mu bisu, bisu lili mu ufutala na butsitu. Natee lolo yiniiyi, bisu lili we biimbu bi baatu bali mu ubuma hu buumbu.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Me ndi mu utsonehe benu maniima, a mu umweese benu tsonyi ve, ka benu me ndi mu unzibusa, we baana ba me ba litondo. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ni mbuli, benu utwala ubaha kuumi li biveeve bi basuungihi mu Kristo, ka benu a lili na bataata ba balahi ve, ŋa yulu a me. Itwadi na Yisu Kristo, me ni wu abuta benu, mu tooni ati, me ni wu ayabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upondo huli benu, duukalaani mbiili a me.<verse eid="1CO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ni buuna me ndi mu utsindaha benu Timoteho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Mav 16.1</ref></char></note> wu li mwana a me wu litondo, na wu a ngetetee mu Pfumu. Nde sa ayibwala benu moonyi ndyatili a me mu Yisu Kristo, we bu me ndi mu undongese mu mabundu ma Nzambi moosi.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Bakima mu benu bali mu usa likwayi, mu tooni ati, bo bali mu utsima ti me a humbwenzamono benu ve. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ka tso Pfumu tondi, me tsanzamono benu. Buuna, me tsanzaaba mambu ma banga likwayi mo baana. Ka a ndulu mambu ma bo ve, napa matwala ma bo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Mu tooni ati, ipfumu hya Nzambi a hili dyambu li mikuma ve, ka dyambu li matwala. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Benu hima litondi? Me nza huli benu na likaanda, vooti na mutima wu litondo na wa kulimini?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bubembo mutso libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Lili mu uyuha tangu yoosi ndyatili yi bumbembo ŋa hati la benu, bumbembo mu iteesi hi baavelemono tso huli bangoyi. Bali mu huleele tsi yoosi ti ŋa hati la benu baatu bali mu usa mayamba. Mayamba mu iteesi hi inono, hi tso bangoyi buuvelekuhasa. Lili mu uyuha ti mumosi mu benu, li mu upala na mukadi a taata a nde! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Na benu lili ba baabaluula mu likwayi! Benu likiiba mu lingebe li laafulala! Benu likiibinga wu li mu ubaasa mavaanga ma pila yiina ŋa hati la benu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Mu me, tso bu me avele na benu mu musunya, me ndi ŋa hati la benu mu matsimi. Me amiikwatsundasa nga mavaanga mo maana, we me hu li ŋa busina. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Mu nduhi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu, na mu matwala ma nde, ŋa benu lukuukama, me tsa mba na benu itwadi mu matsimi. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Benu laafwana uyeholo muutu wa pila mo yiina huli Saatana, mu tooni uduba iteesi hi imuutu mu nde, mana muvumu a nde afuuha mu ilumbu hya tsyelele hya Pfumu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Mu hima benu lili mu usa likwayi? Buuna a buli bubwe ve. Benu liyaabi lo bubwe: «Mwana levure hole ndulu, libaavaatisa lidaama li mapa moosi.» <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Nyaha benu litsyeme! Masaani mu benu levure la tsikulu, mana benu likituha we lidaama li mapa li linyatihi li laavele na levure. Benu laamiikwatsyeme, mu tooni ati, Kristo, limeme la bisu la Paake, akwidi mu tooni a benu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Buuna, nyaha bisu a benu lisaani mukungi a bisu wa Paake, na mapa ma mavele a tso levure li likulu, tso levure la pangili bubi mu bana, buuve li mutima bubi. Ka, lisaani mukungi a bisu wa Paake, na levure li lisuunga na li imbuli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Mu muhanda a me wa tsyelele, me atsonehe benu mu ubaaveleba likoongo na banga mayamba. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Me a hatondi uleele ve ti, benu laafwana utahuha hoosi na bo baana, ba mu tsi mo yiniiyi, ba bali mu udyata hutso mayamba, ba nga nyungu, biibi, ba bali mu ukuunda bifwita. Tso hu li buuna, benu laafwana upala mu tsi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Me tondi uleele ti benu lafwana utahuha na muutu wu li mu uleele ti nde «mukristo», ka nde li mu ubaabwedyata mu bumbembo, buuve li na linyungi, li mu ubwekuunda bifwita, li mu ubwekuta mapfuundu, li ikolobuungu, buuve muyibi. Na baatu ba pila mo yiina, benu a lafwana tso udya na bo ve.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />A hu li na tsongo huli me, mu utsundasa ba bavele mu Kristo ve. Ka ni ba bali hutso libundu benu laafwana mu utsundasa. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Ba bali hu mbadi, Nzambi sa atsundasa bo. Mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele ti: «Bingaani mubi ŋa hati la benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Pfu 13.5</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Utsundasana ŋa busu bu bangoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ŋa mumosi mu benu ukaakana na mwana a ngu, buni nde hutwala uyakese wuna ŋa busu bu banzonzi ba bangoyi? Mu hima mu uveleyene huli baatu bangidi mu uvaanga musamu mo wuuna? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Benu a laayaaba ve ti, baatu ba Nzambi ni ba buutsundasa tsi? Tso baasoolo benu mu uba banzonzi ba tsi yoosi, benu a luutwala usuungaha misamu mi mikeehe ve? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Benu a liyaabi ve ti, bisu a benu sa litsundasa bapofi? Tandisini misamu mya pasi ilumbu! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa benu libaakaakana mu tooni misamu mi idiingu mo hiniihi, benu libaasuusa bangoyi mu uba banzonzi! <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ni musamu a tsonyi huli benu! Ŋa hati la benu a hu li na muutu nga tsiki wu utwala usuungaha dyambu la baana ba ngu ve? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />A hu li bu bwe ve ti, mwana a ngu mumosi akaakana na mwana a ngu mukima, ŋa busu bu banzonzi ba baaveleyaaba Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Mbuli, utaanda ŋa hati la benu aka iliimbu hya mbwili a benu. Mu hima benu libaavele kama mu mutima ŋa busu bwa mambu ma bali mu ukwiha benu? Mu hima benu laavelesiinga ti bapatula benu bisiha bya benu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ka benu libaavyoselele, benu ni ba lili mu ubaakwiha bana mambu ma maavelefwana, ubaapatula bisiha bya bo. Titswene, benu lili mu uvaanga maana ŋa busu bwa baana ba ngu ba benu mwakulu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Benu liyaabi ti ba bali mu usa bubi a buukoto hu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve. A liba hu iliba ve: tso baatu banga bumbembo, tso ba bali mu usalila bifwita, tso banga mayamba, tso ba bahala ba bali mu ukwele ba bahala na bo, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />tso biibi, tso banga linyungi, tso bikolo-mbungu, tso bakuti ba mapfuundu, tso banga soho, bo baana boosi a buubaha mbuha mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Buuna ni bu bakima ŋa hati la benu baaba. Ka benu baaswaha, baatsyemese benu mu masumu, na benu aka ba baakuha mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu Kristo, na mu Livupu la Nzambi a bisu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyutu yili nzo Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Benu libaaleele: «Me ndi na muswa mu usa pasi li me tondi — ka pasi isiha a hili tsoongo ve — me ndi na muswa mu usa pasi li me tondi.» Ni mbuli, ka me a hatondi ukoto hutso buviha ve. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Baatu bubaaleele ti: «Byudya baavaanga mu tooni a moonyi, na moonyi baavaanga mu tooni a byudya.» Ni mbuli, ka ilumbu imosi, Nzambi sa tsala byo byosi. Ka kelaani, nyutu a bisu a benu a baavaanga yo mu bumbembo ve. Yo yili ya Pfumu, na Pfumu li mu nyutu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nzambi wu haasuuli Pfumu ŋa hati la babaakwa, sa asuula bisu kaka mu matwala ma nde. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Benu a liyaabi ve ti nyutu a benu yili binama bya Kristo? Na buuna, me tsa tsalila binama bya Kristo mu uba nyutu mosi na mukaasu mayamba? Naana! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Benu a liyaabi ve ti bahala li luupfuutana na mukaasu mayamba, buna a nde ka nyutu mosi? Mu tooni ati baasonehe: «Bo baboole sa baba ndulu ka muutu mumosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mba 2.24</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ka woosi wu upfutana na Pfumu, nde ka mumosi na nde mu Livupu.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ni mu buuna, baabataani bumbembo. Pasi lisumu li muutu huusa, lo lili hu mbadi a nyutu, ka woosi wu ubaasalila bumbembo li mu usumana nyutu a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Buuve, benu a liyaabi ve ti nyutu a benu yili nzo Livupu la Ngidi li lili mu benu, li Nzambi haaviidi benu? Ni mu buuna, nyutu a benu a yaasaala ya benu ve. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Nzambi ayobolo benu mu talu yinene. Buuna, baayusaani nde mu nyutu a benu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mvutu mu byuhu bi makwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Bunuubu, limamonwaani ma benu laasonehele me mu muhanda a benu mu tooni makwele. Benu laafula me tso hwafwana huli bahala buuve mukaasu mu upfuuta taangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakima bali mu utsima ti Pahuli li mu ulongese libundu ti, hufwani huli Bakristo mu uvelekwele.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ka mu tooni uvelekoto hutso bumbembo, pasi bahala laafwana uba na mukadi a nde, na pasi mukaasu afwana uba na mulumi a nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mulumi afwana ukuhasa manzala ma mukadi a nde, ni bumosi kaka huli mukadi mu mulumi a nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mukadi utwala usa ma nde hatondo mu nyutu a nde mwakulu ve: nyutu a nde yili yi mulumi a nde. Bumosi kaka, mulumi utwala usa ma nde hatondo mu nyutu a nde mwakulu ve: nyutu a nde yili yi mukadi a nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />A libisa upfuuta taangi ve. Benu utwala usa buuna, tso benu liyuhisini mu itwadi mu uvyoso mwana a tangu mu lisambulu. Titswene, futahalaani mbiili a benu yi makwele we hutsomi. Tso a buuna ve, benu utwala uva Saatana muswa, mu ulobese benu mu tooni a pelili mifudi mi utuma nyutu a benu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Moosi ma me ndi mu ndeele benu maniima, mali nzila yi benu luutwala usalila, ka a matumili ve. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Me tondi ti baatu boosi baba bapalaata we me. Ka pasi muutu na matwala ma Nzambi haava nde: mumosi matwala mo maniima, mukima matwala makima.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Mono ma me tondi uleele huli bapalaata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bapalaata </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muutu wu avele na mukadi buuve mulumi.</char></note> na huli bakwili: hufwani huli benu mu uhwada mu ubaaba siha we me. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ka tso benu a litwali ukama mutima mu uba palaata ve, kwelaani: bubwe mu ukwele, mu uvelekwamisa nyutu mu manzala ma musunya.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Huli ba baakwele, me piidi tumili mo yiniiyi, yi yimati huli Pfumu, ka a huli me ve: «Mukadi utwala ukabuha na mulumi a nde ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Mty 5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:3-9">19.3-9</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Tso nde kabuhi na mulumi, nyaha nde abwevelekwele, tso a buuna ve, nde anoongo na mulumi a nde. Mulumi kaka avelebinga mukadi a nde.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Huli bakima, mono ma me undeele — a Pfumu li mu utoyo ve, ka me mwakulu — tso mulumi wu li Mukristo li na mukadi wu avele Mukristo, wu miisiinga utsahala na nde, mulumi anyaha ubinga nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Bumosi kaka, tso mukadi wu li Mukristo li na mulumi wu avele Mukristo, na wu miisiinga utsahala na nde, nde anyaha ubinga mulumi a nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ni mu buuna, mulumi wu avele Mukristo uba wa ngidi mu tooni mukadi a nde, na mukadi wu avele Mukristo uba wa ngidi mu tooni itwadi hya na mulumi a nde wu li Mukristo. Tso a buuna ve, baana ba benu buuba ba baaveletsyeme, ka hwande bo ba baatsyeme bali. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Tso wu avele Mukristo tondi ukabuha na mulumi buuve na mukadi a nde wu li Mukristo, nyahaani huba buuna. Umono ti ni buuna, mulumi buuve mukadi wu li Mukristo, li bunyanga mu tooni ati, Nzambi ateele benu mu uba mu hyenze. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />We mukadi wa Mukristo, buni we uyaaba tso we ufuuhasa mulumi a we? Buuve, buni we mulumi wa Mukristo, uyaaba tso we ufuuhasa mukadi a we?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwilala bu we aba ŋa Nzambi haateeli we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ŋa yulu a dyambu mo liniili, nyaha pasi muutu asiinga uba mutso mandilu ma Pfumu haasa mu nde, we bu nde haaba ŋa Nzambi haateeli nde. Maana ni ma me ndi mu utuma mu mabundu moosi. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Tso muutu aba wu baakete ŋa Nzambi haateeli nde, nde a haswehe ketili a nde ve. Tso mukima aba kini a baaketi ve, nde a hatuma bakete nde ve. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Uba wu baakete buuve wu baavelekete, a hu li na tsoongo ve: hi hili na tsoongo, ni ubaasiingala matumili ma Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Pasi muutu afwana uba we bu nde haaba ŋa Nzambi haateeli nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />We aba muviha ŋa Nzambi haateeli we? A haba na boomo, ka tso nzila yidibumi huli we mu uba bunyanga, bingalala ŋaana. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Mu tooni ati, muviha wu Pfumu haateeli, li muutu wu aka bunyanga mu usalila nde. Ni bumosi kaka, muutu wu li bunyanga wu Pfumu haateeli, li muviha a Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Nzambi asuumbi benu mu talu yinene! Ni mu buuna, a likituha baviha ba baatu ve. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Mu mbuli, baana ba ngu, nyaha pasi muutu aba we bu nde haaba ŋa Nzambi haateeli nde.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byuhu mu tooni a ba baavelekwele na bakwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Mu ma mali mu utala banuumba ba baavelekwele, me a handi na tumili a Pfumu ve. Ka me ndi mu upa matsimi ma me, we muutu wu baatu buusiila hiitu, mu tooni a bubwe bwa Pfumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Mu tooni munyongi a tangu mo yiniiyi, matsimi ma me ni maniima: hwaafwana huli pasi muutu mu ukwilala we bu nde ali. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />We li bahala li laakwele? A ubila utsala kwele ve. We a hali wu akwele ve? Nyaha usaha ukwele. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ka tso we kweli, we a hasiidi lisumu ve. Na tso nuumba kweli, nde a hasiidi lisumu ve. Ka ba buukwele, buubwana na mapasi mu idiingu hya bo hya pasi ilumbu, na me tondi uyibusa benu mana benu a libwana na mapasi mo maana.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Baana ba ngu, me tondi uleele ti, husaali mwana tangu hoole mu uto mu ilumbu hya Pfumu. Bunuubu, hwafwana ti babahala ba baakwele, baba we ba baavelekwele; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />ba bali mu ulila, baba we ba bali mu uvelelila; ba bali mu kinya, baba we ba baavele mu kinya; ba bali mu usuumba bisiha, baba we ba baavele na bisiha; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />na ba bali mu usalila bya tsi mo yiniiyi, bavelekangama mu byo. Mu tooni ati, bu tsi mo yiniiyi yili, yo a yuubwediinga bulahi ve.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Me tondi ti benu livele na minyongo. Wu avelekwele ubaasala mu tooni libwe li misamu mya Pfumu. Ma nde matsimi ndulu mu ubaamweese Pfumu kinya. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ka wu li wu akwele, ubaasala mu tooni libwe li misamu mya tsi mo yiniiyi. Ma nde matsimi ndulu mu ubaamweese mukadi a nde kinya, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />na nde li ŋa hati li matsimi moole. Ni bumosi kaka, mukaasu wu avelekwele, buuve nuumba, ubaasala mu tooni libwe li misamu mya Pfumu, mu tooni ati, nde tondi uba wu akangama woosi mu Pfumu, mu moosi ma nde ali mu usa na utsima. Ka mukaasu wu li wu akwele ubaasala mu tooni libwe li misamu mya tsi mo yiniiyi, nde ubaasaha umweese mulumi a nde kinya. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Me ndi mu undeele buuna, mu tooni libwe la benu, ka a mu utehele benu mweto ve. Me tondi ti benu libaasa ma maasinzafulala bubwe, na benu libaasinzakangama mu isalu hya Pfumu Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Bunuubu, tso mupfudu-mbahala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mupfudu-mbahala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bakima bali mu utsima ti ndongisili mo yiniiyi yili mu utala taata buna mwana a nde, wu li mu ukeele makwele.</char></note> tsimi ti nde li mu uvyoso mutaangula a nde taangu bu nde havelekwele nde, na tso nde li na peyu makwele, na tondi ti bo bakwelesene, aka ni bakwelesene we bu nde atoondi, nde a husa lisumu ve. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ka tso mupfudu-mbahala, voli kesili hutso mutima a nde mu uvelekwele, hwavele tooni ukwamisa nde, tso nde twali ukama mutima, na uvolo kesili mu uvelepfuuta taangi na mutaangula a nde, nde li mu usa bubwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Ni mu buuna, wu li mu ukwele mutaangula a nde, li mu usa bubwe. Ka wu ubaabisa mu usa buuna, ubaafulala usa bubwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mukaasu akangama na mulumi a nde taangu yi mulumi akini moonyi. Ka tso mulumi a nde kwidi, nde ka bunyanga mu ukwele wu nde atoondi, ka ibiinda ti lo laafwana uba kwele la mu Pfumu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Bunuubu, mukaasu mo wunuuwu ufulala uba mu kinya tso nde velibwekwele. Maana ni matsimi ma me, na me tsimi ti me kaka ndi na Livupu la Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mvutu mu byuhu mu banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Bunuubu, litsikahaani ma mali mu utala banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita. Bisu liyaabi ti bisu na nzaabili. Ni mbuli nzaabili mo yiina yibaava muutu nyeme, ka litondo libaakulasa libundu. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Tso muutu li mu utsima mu nde mwakulu ti nde na nzaabili, nde kini a habaha yo we bu hwafwana ve. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ka tso muutu tondi Nzambi, Nzambi yaabi nde.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ni mu buuna, mu li litali udya hu banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita, bisu liyaabi ti bifwita bya mu tsi, a bili banzambi ba mbuli ve. Ka Nzambi ndulu mumosi li wa mbuli. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Tso bu baatu bakima bali mu utsima ti hu li na banzambi hu yulu na ŋa toto, hwande ni mbuli, bo mbiinga. Baatu mo baana bali mu uleele ti hu li na «banzambi» ba balahi na «bapfumu» ba balahi. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Ka huli bisu, Nzambi ndulu mumosi, ni Taata wu avanga bisiha byosi na wu bisu lili moonyi mu nde. Na hu li kaka na Pfumu ndulu mumosi, Yisu Kristo, mu nde Nzambi haavaanga bisiha byosi, na mu nde bisu lili moonyi.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ka boosi a baabangula imbuli mo hiniihi ve, mu tooni ati bakima baaba baakangama mu ipfu hyubaakunda bifwita. Natee lolo yiniiyi, bakini mu ubaadya banyama ba baayeholo, na matsimi ti, baayehuli bo bungodu bwa tsuhili huli banzambi ba bo. Ni buuna, matsimi ma bo mali mu utsundana. Bo bali mu utsima ti, tso baadidi bo, bo baamiisumaha. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ka a ni byudya, byususala bisu ŋa pedu a Nzambi ve. Bisu a luuvinda pasi isiha ve tso livelidya byo. Tso lidiidi byo, bisu a luubaha kaka kaluha tso mosi ŋa yulu ve.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ka kebaani, mana bunyanga bu benu lili mu usalila, a bubwisa hutso lisumu, ba baavelebama mu imiinu. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Tso muutu mumosi, wu avelehwada mu imiinu, moni we nga nzaabili, atsahala mu udya mu nzo a nzambi bifwita, nde kaka sa ahwada mu matsimi ma nde mwakulu, mu udya nyama wu baayeholo huli bifwita. <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ni mu buuna, muutu mo wunuuwu, wu kini a hawadi mu imiinu ve, wu Kristo haakwidi mu tooni a nde, sa anyambana mu tooni a nzaabili a we. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Tso benu lili mu usumaha buuna ŋa busu bwa baana ba ngu, na ubaanemese matsimi ma bo ma makini a maahwada ve, benu lili mu usa lisumu ŋa busu Kristo nde mwakulu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ni mu buuna, tso bi me ndi mu undya bili mu ubwisa mwana a ngu a me mu masumu, me apfwana ubisa byo nzyeni, mu uveleba tooni a mbwili a nde.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Musali afwana mu uyaka pfuta a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Me a handi bunyanga ve? Me a handi iluumbi hya Yisu ve? Me a hamoni Yisu Pfumu a bisu ve? Benu a lili mbutu a isalu hya me mu Pfumu ve? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Tso bu bakima bubaavelesilasa ti me iluumbi hya Yisu, ka uto ti mu benu, mbuli me iluumbi me ndi. Ni mu buuna, bu benu laakangama mu Pfumu, benu mwakulu lili iliimbu ti me ndi iluumbi hya Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ŋa busu bwa ba bali mu utsundasa me, me ndi mu ukala linyutu la me. Mono buni me tondi mu uleele: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />me a handi na muswa mu uyaka byudya na byunwya mu isalu hya me ve? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Me a handi na muswa mu udyenge na mukadi wa Mukristo, we bu biluumbi bikima bubaasa, na baana ba ngu a Pfumu na Peetelo ve? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Buuve, ndulu ni bisu a Baranabasi laafwana usala mu ubaha bi ubuungala musunya? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Leelaani ati me: benu laamiiyuha ti lisadaadu libaasala mu mbongo a nde mwakulu? Buuve musali a ngundu, aveledya miluunda mi miti mi nde haakuna? Buuve keedi biboodi, ali bunyanga mu usalila mabeelo ma biboodi bi nde ubaabuungala ve?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Mambu ma me ndi mu undeele, a mali mu umata mu nzaabili yi imuutu ve. Mu tooni ati, Mikele mya Moose kaka mili mu uleele bumosi. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ni mbuli, mutso Mikele baasonehe bunuubu: «A laakutala munywa a ngombe, wu li mu usala mu taangu yi nde ubaadyata muhunu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Pfu 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ti 5.18</ref></char></note>.» Nzambi lingebe li bangombe ali na lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />A ni mu tooni a bisu baatu, nde haatoyi buuna ve? Eeye, ni mbuli! Ni mu tooni a bisu baasonehe dyambu mo liniili. Nyaha wu li mu upuka na wu li mu ukoolo mbutu, bo baboole babaasala mu hiitu hi ubaha kabu la bo la mbutu. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Bisu laakuna muhunu wu livupu ŋa hati la benu. Hu li dyambu la pasi tso bisu litsonzihi busina bwa benu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Tso bakima bali mu ubahila mu benu, bisu a lili na muswa mu ufulala ubahila mu benu ve?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ka bisu a laatondo usa buuna ve. Homo, bisu laasiingi ukuunda mapasi moosi, mu uvelekubasa Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo mabaku. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ka benu liyaabi lo bubwe: ba bali mu usa isalu mu nzo a Nzambi, baafwana ubaha byudya bya bo mu nzo a Nzambi. Titswene, ba bubaasala ŋa metse ma tsuhili bungodu, baafwana uyaka la bo kabu mu bungodu mo buuna<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:9">Lev 6.9</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 6:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:1-3">Pfu 18.1-3</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ni bumosi kaka, Pfumu hatuma ti ba bubaalongese Musamu wu Mubwe baafwana ubuungala musunya a bo mu isalu mo hiina.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ka me, me a hakwamisa benu mu ufuta me tso pfuta mosi ve. Me a handi mu utsonehele benu mu uvondo benu busina ve. Bubwe hwande huli me mu ukwa, ka a mu unyaha pasi muutu mu umaasa me inyemunu mo hiina ve.<verse eid="1CO 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ni mu buuna, me a handi na nyeme mu ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe ve. Hyo hili isalu hi ubaakwiha me. Me upelendongese Musamu wu Mubwe, ni lingebe huli me. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Tso me atsooli me mwakulu isalu mo hiniihi, me akiimbaha pfuta a pasi tsungi. Ka bu baakwiha me hyo, hwafwana huli me ndulu mu ukuhasa isalu hi baava me. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Pfuta a me ka ki yo? Ni kinya yi ubaalongese Musamu wu Mubwe mu bungodu, hwavele uvondo bisiha bi me apfwana ubaha mu tooni a ndongisili a Musamu wu Mubwe.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isalu hi iluumbi hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Eye, me ndi bunyanga. Me a handi muviha a pasi muutu ve. Ka me amiikituha we muviha a baatu boosi, mana me mbehe huli Kristo litangu linene la baatu. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Bu me ndi itwadi na Bayudaayo, me ndi mu umonehele we Muyudaayo, mu tooni ubita Bayudaayo huli Yisu. Tso me apele hu tsina lituma li Mikele mya Moose, ŋa me ndi na baatu ba bali hu tsina a lituma li Mikele, me ndi mu udyata we wu li hu tsina lituma li Mikele, mana me mbita bo huli Yisu. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Na bu me ndi itwadi na ba baaveleyaaba Mikele mya Moose, me ndi we wu avele hu tsina lituma li Mikele mana me mbita bo huli Yisu. Buuna a butondi uleele ti, me a handi hu tsina lituma li Mikele mya Nzambi ve, ka me ndi hu tsina Mikele mya Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Bu me ndi itwadi na baatu ba baakolo mu imiinu, me ndi we wu akolo mu imiinu, mana me mbita bo huli Yisu. Buuna, me ndi mu upaanga moosi huli boosi, mu uyobolo bakima mu bo. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Me ndi mu utsa maana moosi, mu tooni a Musamu wu Mubwe, mana me mbaha kabu li bisiha bi Musamu wu Mubwe haamiisa lahi.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Benu liyaabi ti baatu ba bali mu uvaangana mu tiinu, bali mu ubata tiinu bo boosi, ka ndulu muutu mumosi ubaabiinga. Ni mu buuna, benu kaka laafwana ubata tiinu mu iteesi hya mbiingili. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Baatu boosi ba bubaabata tiinu bubaasalila mangidi ma malahi mu uhwadisa nyutu a bo, mu tooni ubaha mutata wu tsongo yuvelekwilala. Ka bisu a benu lili mu usaha mutata wu tsongo yukwilala. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu umbata tiinu a miisu itsotsi, bu me afwana na mulwani makome, wu aveletete makome hyayuhu. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Me ndi mu umweese nyutu a me pasi, me ndi mu utsundasa yo. Me ndi mu utsa buuna, mu tooni ati, humbisa ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe huli bakima, me mwakulu a hampinda mutata a mbingili.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ukebese mu tsalili a bifwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Baana ba ngu, me tondi ti benu liyibuhala moonyi mu ma maayiili bakaha ba bisu mu tangu a Moose. Yidu laakaswehe bo boosi, titswene bo baasabuhi Mubu wu Mubenge<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Pal 13.21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:22">Pal 14.22</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Hutso a yidu na hutso mubu, bo baayaki tondihili itwadi na Moose. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bo boosi baadiidi byudya ni byo bimosi bi Nzambi haaviidi bo. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Bo boosi baanywidi mamba ni mo mamosi ma Nzambi haaviidi bo. Mu mbuli bo baakanywa ŋa manya li Nzambi haalahi bo, li laakaduukala bo. Manya mo liina aba ni Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ka ba balahi ŋa hati la bo a baaba ba babwe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi ve, ni mu buuna bo baakwidi lahi-lahi mu kumu a nzala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:16">Mat 14.16</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Biina ni bifwaani mu tooni a bisu, mana bisu livele na manzala ma mabi, we bu bo baabahi mo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Mat 11.4</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 11:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:14">Mkg 106.14</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />A likuunda bifwita ve, we bu bakima ŋa hati la bo baakuundi byo. We bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Baatu baatsahili mu udya, mu unywa, titswene baatelimi mu ukina hu ubi ŋa busu bu bifwita<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Pal 32.6</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Bisu a laafwana usalila bumbembo ve, we bu bakima ŋa hati la bo baasalili. Maku moole ma biveeve, na biveeve bitatu (23 000) bya baatu, baakwidi mu ilumbu imosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Mat 25.1-18</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Bisu a lafwana ulobese Kristo we bu bakima ŋa hati la bo baasiidi ve, na mu buuna, bo baakwidi mu tooni bataadi ba baakahi bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:5">Pfu 21.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:14">Mkg 106.14</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Nyahaani uŋono, we bu bakima ŋa hati la bo baaŋoni, na pofi lipfu amani uduba bo.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Mapasi mo maana maabwili bo, mana maba imbangi huli baatu bakima. Baasonihi mo mu uyibusa bisu, mu tooni ati, bisu laaka bebele a taangu ya tsukusu. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ni mu buuna, nyaha wu li mu utsima ti nde ahwada mu imiinu, akebe mu uvelebwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Malobese ma maayiili benu ni ma mubaayiila mu baatu boosi. Ni mu buuna, Nzambi wu li ngetetee mu malahi ma nde, a husiingasa ve ti malobese mavyoho mifudi mya benu. Ka mu tangu a lobese, nde sa ava benu mifudi mi myayelemene, mu ukuunda lo na nzila yi upala hutso a lo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:12-13">Yak 1.12-13</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Ni mu buuna, bambaahi ba litondo, kebaani mu ubaakuunda bifwita. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Me ndi mu utoyo na benu we huli baatu ba nga buyedi. Silasaani benu mwakulu ma me ndi mu undeele. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Mbuungu yi lisyeme, yi bisu libaafutala Nzambi matondo, ŋa lili mu unywa yo, a yili itwadi hya bisu na makila ma Kristo ve? Lipa li bisu libaatabula, ŋa lili mu udya ilaambu hya Pfumu, a lili itwadi hya bisu na nyutu a Kristo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mty 26.26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mlk 14.22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luk 22.19-20</ref></char></note>? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Mu tooni ati, lipa lili ndulu limosi. Tso bu bisu lili ba balahi, bisu lili nyutu mosi, na bisu lili mu ukabasana lipa limosi liniili.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Monwaani buli li Isereli: baatu ba bali mu udya banyama, ba bayeholo mu bungodu bwa itwadi na Nzambi. Buuna, bo bali mu ukuunda nde mu nzila mo yiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lev 7.6</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 7:15-16">15-16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Hima me ndi mu undeele? Ti nyama wu baayeholo mu bungodu huli bifwita li na tsoongo? Buuve ti ifwita hili na tsoongo? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Naana! Ka bi bali mu uyeholo, bali mu uyeholo byo huli bifwita, bali mu ukuunda matengo, ka a Nzambi ve. Ni mu buuna, me a hatondi ti benu liba itwadi na matengo ve. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Benu utwala unywa nzila mosi mbuungu a Pfumu na mbuungu a matengo ve. Benu utwala utsahala nzila mosi ŋa meetse ma Pfumu na ŋa meetse ma matengo ve. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Buuve bisu litondi ti Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Pfu 32.21</ref></char></note> abahila bisu a benu nyengi? Ti bisu a benu laalutahala nde mifudi?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvaanga mambu moosi mu tooni muyusu a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Eeye, «byosi baava muswa» we bu benu libaaleele, ka byosi a bili na tsoongo mu bisu ve. Mu mbuli, «byosi baava muswa», ka byosi a bili mu ukulasa imiinu ve. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Nyaha pasi muutu a hasaha ndulu kaluha a nde mwakulu, ka asaha fula-fula yi bakima.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Benu utwala udya byosi bi bali mu usuumbasa hu saandu hwavele uva byuhu bi byumwese benu mutima pasi. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Mbuli, we bu baasonehe: «Toto na byosi bi bili mu yo bili bya Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Mkg 24.1</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Tso muutu wu avele na imiinu mu Nzambi, tsihi we mu udya na tso we siingi, dya hwawe byosi bi buuva we, hwavele uva byuhu bi byumwese we mutima pasi. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ka tso muutu leeli we: «Nyama mo wunuuwu baayeholo nde mu bungodu huli bifwita,» nyaha udya nde, mu tooni a nde wu miiyibusa we, na mu uvelemweese we mutima pasi. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ŋa me ndi mu undeele «uvelemweese mutima pasi», me a handi mu undeele mutima a we ve, ka mutima a muutu wu yibusi we.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Tso ni buuna, mu hima mutima a muutu mukima hutwala utsundasa me mu mambu ma me ndi mu upanga mu bunyanga bwosi? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Tso me ndi bunyanga mu mutima a me, mu ufutala Nzambi matondo mu bi me ndi mu undya, mu hima baatu buutsundasa me mu tooni a byo?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ni mu buuna, tso benu laadya, tso laanywa, tso laasa pasi byo, vaangaani byosi mu tooni muyusu a Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />A liba bakubisi ba baku huli Bayudaayo, tso huli bangoyi, tso huli ba bali mu libundu la Nzambi ve. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Baadyataani we me: me ndi mu ukwada mu umweese kinya huli baatu boosi mu mambu moosi. Me a handi mu utsaha libwe la me mwakulu ve, ka libwe la baatu ba balahi, mana bo bayoboho.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Duukalaani ndyatili a me, we bu me ndi mu unduukala ndyatili a Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaasu afwana ufuungala mutswe mu mukungi a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Me ndi mu unzuusa benu bu benu lili mu uyibuhala me moonyi mu pasi dyambu, na bu benu lili mu uduukala matumili ma me apiidi benu. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ka me tondi ti benu liyaaba liniili: Kristo ni mutswe a pasi bahala, bahala ni mutswe a mukaasu, na Nzambi ni mutswe a Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Ni mu buuna, tso bahala lili mu usambila tso lili mu ubihula li laafuha mutswe, lo lili mu urokolo Kristo wu li mutswe a lo. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ka tso mukaasu li mutswe bwasi ŋa nde ali mu usambila tso ŋa nde ali mu ubihula, nde li mu urokolo mulumi a nde. Ni tsonyi huli nde, we mukaasu wu baakuula mutswe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Tso mukaasu a hafuhi mutswe a nde ve, nde afwana kaka ukese nanga a nde! Ka mu tooni ti ni tsonyi huli mukaasu mu ukese naanga, buuve mu ukuula mutswe, nde afwana mu ubaafuha mutswe a nde. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Bahala a lili na nzala mu ufuha mutswe a nde ve. Mu tooni ti lo lili ifwaani na muyusu a Nzambi, ka mukaasu li muyusu a bahala. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Mu mbuli, bahala a baavaangi mu nyutu a mukaasu ve. Ka mukaasu ni wu baavaangi mu nyutu a bahala. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Na bahala a baavaangi mu tooni a mukaasu ve, ka mukaasu ni wu baavaangi mu tooni a bahala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Mba 1.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">2.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">2.18-23</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ni mu buuna, mu tooni bapofi, mukaasu afwana ubaaba na iliimbu hu yulu mutswe a nde, hi hili mu umweese lituma la nde. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ka ŋa busu bwa Pfumu, mukaasu a utwala mu uba hwavele a bahala ve, bahala kaka utwala mu uba hwavele a mukaasu ve. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Mu tooni ati, we bu baavaangi mukaasu mu nyutu a bahala, bahala libaabutama mu mukaasu, na byosi bibaamata huli Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Tsikahaani benu mwakulu: hwafwana huli mukaasu mu uba mutswe bwasi ŋa nde ali mu usambila Nzambi? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Bipfu bya tsoongo bili mu umweese ti, a hwafwana huli bahala mu ubaaba na naanga yinda ve. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Ka, ni muyusu huli mukaasu mu ubaaba na yo. Naanga yinda baaviidi yo huli mukaasu mu ubaaswehe nde nyutu. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ka tso muutu tondi usobosono matsimi mu musamu mo wunuuwu, nde afwana uyaaba liniili: tso mabundu ma Nzambi, tso bisu mwakulu a lili na ipfu ikima ve.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilaambu hya Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mty 26.26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mlk 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luk 22.19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Mu mambu ma mu udukala, mu li litali makutuunu ma benu, me a hunzuusa benu ve. Mu tooni ati, mu makutuunu ma benu, benu a lili mu uvaanga ma mabwe ve, ka fula-fula ma mabi. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Mu ubaandiha, baayabisa me ti benu na makabu ŋa benu libaasa makutuunu. Me ndi mu utsilasa ti makima ma bali mu uleele me, mali ma mbuli. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Mu mbuli, hufwani huli benu mu uba na makabu, mana bayaaba ba bali ngetetee ŋa hati la benu. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Monwaani: ŋa benu lili mu upfuutana, a ilaambu hya Pfumu benu libaadya ve. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Mu taangu yi benu libaatsahala ŋa metse, muutu muutu ubaabingalala udya ilaambu hya nde mwakulu. Ni mu buuna, bakima na nzala, bakima na malaangi. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Benu a lili na manzo ma ubaadya na ubaanywa ve? Buuve benu libundu la Nzambi lili mu upenye, na umweese ba baavele na pasi isiha tsonyi? Hima benu libaakeele ti me ndeele benu? Ti me nzuusa benu? Naana, mu mbuli me utwala uyuusa benu mu dyambu mo liina ve.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Mu mbuli, monwaani ndongisili yi me anzaka huli Pfumu na yi me atoosele benu: Pfumu Yisu, mu butsuhu bu baayehuli nde, avoli lipa, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />na humbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde atabuli lo na aleeli: «Yiniiyi ni nyutu a me, yi me ndi mu upa mu benu. Baasaani bunuubu mu ubaayibuhala me moonyi.» <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Bumosi kaka, bu bo baamani udya, nde avoli mbuungu, na aleeli: «Mbuungu mo yiniiyi, ni Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi, yi yaavangama mu nzila makila ma me. Baasaani bunuubu, pasi tangu yi benu luukanywa yo, mu ubaayibuhala me moonyi.» <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Mu mbuli, pasi tangu yi benu luukaadya lipa mo liniili na yi benu luukaanywa mbuungu mo yiniiyi, benu libaayaabisa lipfu la Pfumu natee bu nde huuyafutaha.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu udya lipa buuve unywa mbuungu a Pfumu hwavele usungama, sa abaha tooni yi masumu ŋa busu bwa nyutu na makila ma Pfumu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Nyaha pasi muutu atswamina utsikaha hutso mutima a nde, titswene nde adya lipa na anywa mbuungu mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Mu tooni ati, tso muutu diidi lipa mo liniili na nywiidi mbuungu mo yiniiyi, hwavele utsikaha itwadi hya byo na nyutu a Pfumu, nde li mu udya na unywa tsundusu a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ni mu tooni mo yiina, ba balahi ŋa hati la benu bali babeedu, banga bipiha, na ba balahi baamiikwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Tso bisu libaakengese mitima mya bisu mwakulu, bisu a luubwebwa hu tsina a tsundusu a Nzambi ve. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ka, Pfumu ubaatsundasa na usuungaha bisu, mana bisu liveleyaka tsyembili itwadi na baatu ba tsi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa benu libaapfuutana mu ilaambu hya Pfumu, baakeelaani bana. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Tso muutu li na nzala, nde afwana umaadya hu nzo a nde, mana makutuunu ma benu a mabehele benu tsundusu a Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Uto ti misamu mikima, me tsa tsuungaha myo ŋa me unza huli benu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Bunuubu, baana ba ngu, liyambilaani mu ma mali mu tala bungodu bu Livupu. Me tondi ti benu liyaaba imbuli mu tooni a bwo. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Benu liyaabi ti, ŋa benu laaba kini bangoyi, benu laabwidi mu linyungi li bifwita bi byaveletoyo. Benu a laakatwala ubisala byo ve. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu utsilasa benu lo. A hu li na muutu ve, wu Livupu la Nzambi libaatuma, wu utwala ufulaha ti: «Yisu aba wu baasinga!» Na a hu li na muutu wu utwala mu uleele ti: «Yisu li Pfumu», tso Livupu la Ngidi a lili mu usala mu nde ve.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Hu li na bungodu bwa pila mu pila, ka Livupu ni lo limosi libaava bwo. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Hu li na bisalili bya pila mu pila, ka Pfumu ni nde mumosi bubaasalila. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Hu li na bisalu bya pila mu pila, ka Nzambi ni nde mumosi li mu uva matwala huli baatu boosi mu uvaanga byosi. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Mu pasi muutu, Livupu la Ngidi libaamonehele mu bungodu bwa muutu-muutu, mu tooni libwe la baatu boosi. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Huli muutu mumosi, Livupu libaava bungodu bu ubaatoyo na tsiki. Huli mukima, Livupu ni lo limosi libaava bungodu bu ubaatoyo na nzaabili. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Livupu ndulu ni lo limosi libaava imiinu hya kimuhili huli muutu mumosi, na matwala ma ubeeloso babeedu huli muutu mukima. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Livupu libaava huli muutu mumosi matwala ma ubaavaanga bipadi, huli mukima matwala ma ubaabihula, huli mukima matwala ma ubaasa lisobosono ŋa hati li mavupu ma mapfuta na Livupu la mbuli. Huli mumosi, lo libaava matwala ma ubaatsuha mu mandaha ma pila mu pila. Huli mukima, matwala ma ubaabindula mandaha mo maana. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Livupu ndulu ni limosi libaavaanga maana moosi. Lo libaava huli pasi muutu bungodu bukima we bu lo libaatondo.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Libundu lili we nyutu yi yili na binama bi bilahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Eeye, Kristo afwanina na nyutu yi yili na binama bi bilahi. Tso bu binama mo biina bili bi bilahi, byo byapfuutana ndulu mu nyutu mosi. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ni mu buuna, tso hu li Bayudaayo, Bangeleke, baviha, buuve ba bali bunyanga, bisu boosi baatondihi itwadi, mana lituunga nyutu mosi. Mu Livupu la Ngidi ndulu ni lo limosi, bisu boosi laanywidi mu idiinga hya lo.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Mu tooni ati, nyutu abaavaanga mu inama imosi ve, ka mu binama bi bilahi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Tso huulu huleeli: «Me a handi kaka ve, buuna me a handi mu nyutu ve». Ka liyaabi ti huulu utwala ubisa uba inama hya nyutu ve. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Na tso tswi lileeli: «Me a handi diisu ve, buuna me a handi mu nyutu ve», lo a luutwala ubisa uba inama hya nyutu ve. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Tso nyutu yoosi yaakiiba diisu, buni baatu baakiibaayuha kele? Tso yo yoosi yaakiiba ndulu tswi, buni baatu baakiibaayuha tsulu? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Mu mbuli, Nzambi asuusi pasi inama mu nyutu we bu nde haatondi. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Tso inama hyakiiba ndulu imosi, a hwakiiba na tsoongo ve. Mu tooni ati, nyutu a yaakiiba ve! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Eeye, binama bili bi bilahi, ka nyutu yili ndulu mosi.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Diisu utwala uleele huli kaka ve ti: «Me a handi na nzala a we ve!» Na, mutswe utwala uleele huli miilu ve ti: «Me a handi na nzala a benu ve!» <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Homo, binama bya nyutu bi byafulala ukolo tso biveli, nyutu yoosi ukwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Na bi bisu libaapenye, bisu libaakiinza byo ufulala binama bikima. Binama bi laavelefwana usyenolo, bisu bibaava byo likiinzu li laafulala. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Buuna, binama bi bisu libaapenye, libaafula ukiinza byo. Nzambi haavaanga buuna, mana babaasinzayuusa binama bi byavele na tsoongo. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Buuna, makabu maveleba mu nyutu, ka binama bya nyutu bili tsiitsa na bibaakumbasana. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Na tso inama imosi hili mu pasi, binama bina byosi bili mu pasi na hyo. Tso inama imosi hiyaki likiinzu, binama bina byosi bili mu kinya na hyo.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Benu lili nyutu a Kristo: pasi nde mu benu li inama hya nyutu a nde. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Ni mu buuna, mu libundu, Nzambi asuusi hati a tsomi biluumbi, hwa moole mimbihuli, hu matatu milongisi. Titswene hu li na bungodu bu usa bipadi, bungodu bu ubeeloso babeedu, bungodu bu ukumbasa, bu ubaatuma, bu utsuha mandaha ma pila mu pila. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Boosi a bali biluumbi ve, buuve mimbihuli, buuve milongisi. Boosi a bali na bungodu bu ubaavaanga bipadi ve, <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />buuve bu ubaabeeloso babeedu, buuve bu utsuha mandaha ma pila mu pila, tso bu ubaabindula mandaha mo maana. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ni mu buuna, benu laafwana usaha ubaha bungodu bu bwafulala tsoongo. Bunuubu, me tsambwemweese benu nzila yi yaafulala bubwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili mu litondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Tso me ndi mu utsuha mandaha ma baatu na ma bapofi, me upele na litondo, me a handi na tsoongo ve. Me apfwanina na kulambeete buuve binzanza bi bili mu usa kele.<verse eid="1CO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Tso me ndi na bungodu bu ubihula, buuve bwa nzaabili yoosi, na utsikaha matswehi moosi, na tso me ndi na imiinu hi usobo bisyelo mambuha, ka tso me peli na litondo, me a handi na tsoongo ve!<verse eid="1CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Tso me kabili bya me byosi huli bapuumbu, tso me nzyehuli nyutu a me mana batsuha yo, ka me upele na litondo, maana moosi a mali na kaluha huli me ve.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Litondo lili na mukami, lo lili na bulembo, lo nyengi ve, lo nyeme ve, na lo a libaasaha umonehele ve. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Litondo a libaasa mambu ma tsonyi ve, lo nyinga ve, lo a libaakwakesi ve na lo a libaakaanga piinga ve. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Litondo a libaamono kinya mu mavaanga ma mabi ve, ka lo libaamono kinya mu mambu ma imbuli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Litondo libaakunda moosi. Mu pasi dyambu, lo libaaba na imiinu, na hiitu, na mukonono.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Litondo libaakwilala mu bilima na bilima. Ubihula sa hufwa hu busu, bungodu bu utoyo mandaha ma pila mu pila sa bufwa, na nzaabili sa yidimbala. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Mu mbuli, nzaabili a bisu a yili yi yaakuha ve, na mbihulili a bisu yili yi kusi.<verse eid="1CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ka bu tangu a bibyasupahana yiuya, bi byavelekuha sa bidimbala.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ŋa me amba mwana a ngebe, me akatoyo we mwana a ngebe, me akatsima we mwana a ngebe, me akatsikaha misamu we mwana a ngebe. Ka bu me ka mukuutu, me miitiimba byosi bi bungebe.<verse eid="1CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Mu tangu mo yiniiyi, bisu lili mu umono ndulu isisi hya fifila, hya we hi limwenu li likulu, ka bisu sa limono hiinzi mu hiinzi. Mu tangu mo yiniiyi, me anzaaba ndulu bu hwavelekuha. Ka me tsanzaaba Nzambi we bu hwakuha, ni bumosi, we bu nde mwakulu haayaaba me.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Bunuubu, bisiha mo bi bitatu biniibi byukwilala: imiinu, hiitu na litondo. Ka hi hyafulala bunene mu bi bitatu, ni litondo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili mu tsalili bungodu bu Livupu mutso mabundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ni mu buuna, baasahaani ubaha hati a tsomi litondo. Baasahaani kaka ubaha bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi bwosi, ka hi hyafulala tsoongo, ni bungodu bu ubihula. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Wu li mu utoyo mu ndaha yi bumwenyi, a habaatoyo huli baatu ve, ka huli Nzambi. Mu tooni ati, a hu li na muutu wu li mu utsikaha ma nde ali mu uleele ve. Mu matwala ma Livupu, nde li mu uyaabisa matswehi. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ka wu ubaabihula, ubaatoyo huli baatu. Nde ubaakulasa imiinu hya bo, mu uhwadisa bo na ubombesele bo. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu li mu utoyo mu ndaha yi bumwenyi, ubaahwadisa nde mwakulu mu imiinu. Ka muutu wu ubaabihula, ubaahwadisa libundu loosi.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Me tondi ti benu boosi libaatoyo mandaha ma bumwenyi, ka me pfulitondo ti benu libaabihula. Mu mbuli, muutu wu ubaabihula, tsoongo bele a wu ubaatoyo ndaha yi bumwenyi ve. Tso mumosi ŋa hati la benu ubaatoyo ndaha yi bumwenyi, hwafwana uba na muutu wu ukaabindula yo, mana libundu loosi likula mu imiinu. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Na bunuubu baana ba ngu, tso me nzidi huli benu, na tso me toyili benu mu ndaha yi bumwenyi, ki kaluha benu luubaha? Kaluha ve, beedi bubwe, me mbehele benu mambu ma nzabisili, ma nzaabili, ma mbihulili, buuve ma ndongisili.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Livolwaani ifwaani hi bisihili bya nyimbu we muvembe na kuda, tso byo a bili mu upalisa munyingu wu asobohono ve, buni luutwala uyaaba ti muniingu mo wunuuwu wu muvembe, buuve wa kuda? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Tso kulambeete a yipalisi muniingu wa tsiki ve, buni balwani buuyaaba tso bo baamiivangama mu mudingu? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Bumosi kaka, buni baatu buutsikaha ma benu lili mu utoyo, tso mambu ma benu lili mu upalisa, a mali tsiki ve? Benu lili mu utoyo mu pu. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Hu li mandaha ma pila mu pila mu tsi, ka a hu li na ndaha tso mosi yi yaavele na lisuunga ve. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ka, tso me a handi mu utsikaha ndaha yi me ndi mu unzuha ve, wu ubaatoyo yo sa aba mwenyi ŋa busu bwa me, na me kaka tsamba mwenyi ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Buuna, bu benu lili na nzala ubaha bungodu bu Livupu, sahaani uba bisina bi bungodu, fulafula bu bubaakulasa libundu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ni mu buuna, wu ubaatoyo mu mandaha ma bumwenyi, afwana uvondo huli Nzambi bungodu bu ubiindula mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Mu tooni ati, tso me ndi mu utsambila mu mandaha mo maana, mutima a me li mu usambila, ka buyedi bwa me a buli mu usala ve. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Me ka buni utsa? Me tsatsambila na mutima a me, na me tsatsambila kaka na buyedi bwa me. Me tsanzimba na mutima a me, ka me tsanzimba kaka na buyedi bwa me. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Mu mbuli, tso we futili matondo huli Nzambi ndulu na mutima a we, buni muutu wu li mu uyuha we mu libundu, huutwala ufutala: «Ameni» mu lisambulu la we la pfutili matondo? Nde a hayaabi ma we li mu uleele ve. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Tso lisambulu la we la pfutili matondo lili lilibwe, lo a lili mu uhwadisa baatu ba bali mu uyuha we ve.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Me ndi mu upfutala matondo huli Nzambi, bu me umbaatoyo mu mandaha ma bumwenyi, ufulala benu boosi. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ka ŋa busu bu libundu li limiikuukama, hufwani huli me mu uleele mikuma mitaanu mi baatu buutsikaha mu ulongese bakima, ka a mu uleele kuumi li biveeve (10 000) bi mikuma, mu mandaha ma bumwenyi ve.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Baana ba ngu, a liba we bangebe mu tsimili a benu ve, ka benu lafwana uba bangeele mu tsimili a benu. Baani we bangebe ba bali mu ukuka linyutu, ŋa busu bu bubi. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mabaasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Me tsapyohele mu baatu ba ndaha yi bumwenyi mu utoyo huli baatu mo baniiba,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">buleeli Pfumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">«Me tsatoyele bo mu minywa mya byenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">tso buuna, bo a buusiinga uyahula me ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:49">Pfu 28.49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:11">Esa 28.11</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Buuna, matwala ma uyambila mandaha ma bumwenyi, mali iliimbu huli ba baavelesa imiinu, ka a huli ba bali mu usa imiinu ve. Ka bungodu bu ubihula, buli iliimbu huli ba bali mu usa imiinu, ka a huli ba baavelesa imiinu ve.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Tso libundu loosi likuukimi, na baatu boosi babwidi mu utoyo mu mandaha ma bumwenyi, na tso baatu ba baavelesa imiinu, bayakoto koto la hati a tsomi mu libundu, na uyuha mandaha mo maana, bo sa baleele ti benu banga maladi lili. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ka tso boosi bali mu ubihula, na tso baatu ba baavelesa imiinu, bayakoto koto la hati a tsomi mu libundu, sa basiinga masumu ma bo mu tooni a ma bo bali mu uyuha. Sa batsundasa bo mu mambu moosi ma bo bali mu uyuha <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />na matsimi ma bo ma tswehi, sa mamonehele paayalala. Na bo sa bakongemene na ukuunda Nzambi, na ubaaleele ti: «Nzambi mu mbuli ali ŋa hati la benu!»<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukeelese butsitu mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Baana ba ngu, buni lafwana ubaasa? Ŋa benu libaakuukama, mumosi mu benu sa ayimba mukuunga, wuna sa aba na dyambu la ndongisili, mukima sa ayaka dyambu li luumata huli Nzambi, mukima sa atoyo mu ndaha yi bumwenyi na mukima sa ava mbindulili a mo. Mambu mo maana moosi mafwana ukumbasa libundu mu ukula mu imiinu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Tso baatu bali mu utoyo mu ndaha yi bumwenyi, nyaha baatu boole buuve batatu ndulu batoyo, muutu-muutu mu ya nde tangu. Na mumosi afwana ubindula ma bo bali mu uleele. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Tso mubinduli veli, pasi nde mu bo anyaha upandula ndaha mutso likutuunu. Muutu muutu atoyo na mutima a nde na huli Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Ka uto ti mu mimbihuli, nyaha baatu boole buuve batatu batoyo, mana bakima basilasa ma bo bali mu uleele. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ka tso muutu mukima yaki dyambu li luumata huli Nzambi, nyaha muutu wu li mu utoyo aba swii. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Na buuna, benu utwala ubihula ilandi-ilandi, mana boosi babaha nzaabili na bahwada. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Nyaha ba bali mu ubihula, bayaaba utuma bungodu bu bo baayaka. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a hali Nzambi a hyalasasa ve, ka nde Nzambi wu ubaapalisa hyenze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">We bu hu li mu uvangama mutso mabundu ma Kristo moosi, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />nyaha bakaasu mu mabundu moosi, babaaba swii mu makutuunu. Bo a bali na muswa mu utoyo mu makutuunu ve. Ka bo baafwana uba na kulimini we bu Mikele mili mu uleele. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Tso bo batoondi uyaaba dyambu, bo baafwana ufuula balumi ba bo hu nzo. Hu li tsonyi huli mukaasu mu ubaatoyo mu likutuunu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Mambu ma Nzambi huli benu maabaandiha? Buuve mo ndulu huli benu maayato? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Tso muutu li mu utsima ti nde li mumbihuli, buuve ti nde li na bungodu bu Livupu, nde afwana usilasa ti mambu ma me ndi mu utsonehele benu, mali tumili a Pfumu. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ka nde avelesilasa ti mo mali tumili a Pfumu, Nzambi a hayaabi nde ve.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ni mu buuna baana bangu, baasahaani hati a tsomi bungodu bu ubihula, ka a likala baatu mu utoyo mu mandaha ma pila mu pila ve. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ka, nyaha moosi mavangama we bu hwafwana, hutso butsitu na bu hwasungama.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Tsuuhili a Kristo mu babaakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Baana ba ngu, bunuubu me ndi mu unzibuhala benu Musamu wu Mubwe, wu me anzabisa benu, wu benu laayaka, wu benu laakangama mu nde. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ni mu nde benu luuyoboho, tso benu likaangi nde we bu me anzabisa benu nde. Tso a buuna ve, imiinu hi benu laasa hyuba hya mu pu.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Me ateehili uyaabisa benu ndongisili yi me mwakulu anzaki: Kristo akwa mu tooni masumu ma bisu we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyaabisa. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Baasuusi nde hutso a ngila, nde asuuhi mu ilumbu hi bitatu we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Nde amonihili na Peetelo, titswene na biluumbi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Esa 53.5-12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mkg 16.10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:2">Ose 6.2</ref></char></note> kuumi na byole. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Humbisa, nde amonihili mu tangu mosi na baana ba ngu, litangu uvyoho makama mataanu (500). Ba balahi ŋa hati la bo bakini moonyi, ka mwa bakima baamiikwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Titswene nde amonihili na Yaaki, humbisa na biluumbi byosi. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Hu tsitusu, bu haamani umonehele na bo boosi, nde amonihili na me kaka, tso bu me ndi we mwana wu baabuta mu yimi li laaveleyele.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ni mbuli, me ndi iluumbi hi hyafulala bukenyi ŋa hati li biluumbi. Mu uleele imbuli, me a hapfwana ve ti babaateele me «iluumbi», mu tooni ati, me anyongisi libundu la Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ka mu hyese hya Nzambi, me ndi bu me ndi, na hyese hi nde haava me hili na mifudi. Homo ati, me atsala bele a biluumbi bikima byosi ve, a mu me mwakulu ve, ka ni hyese hya Nzambi hyaakasala mu me. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Buuna, tso hwaba me, tso hwaba biluumbi bina, ni Musamu wu Mubwe wuuna bisu lili mu ulongese, ni nde benu laasa hiitu.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuuhili a banga imiinu mu babaakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Bisu lili mu uta ibila ti Kristo asuuha mu babaakwa. Buni buuna! Me anzuha ti bakima ŋa hati la benu bali mu uleele ti: «Babaakwa a buufutaha hu moonyi ve.» <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Tso babaakwa a buufutaha hu moonyi ve, buuna, Kristo kaka a hasuuha mu babaakwa ve. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Na tso Kristo a hasuuha mu babaakwa ve, ndongisili a bisu yili ya mu pu, na imiinu hya benu kaka hili hya mu pu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Titswene, bisu lili mu umonehele we bambangi ba mapfuta ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu tooni ati, bisu laasilasa ti Nzambi asuula Kristo mu babaakwa. Tso ni mbuli Nzambi a hasuula nde mu babaakwa na ufutala nde hu moonyi ve, buuna, babaakwa a bali mu usuuha ve. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ka, tso babaakwa a bali mu usuuha ve, Kristo kaka a hasuuha mu babaakwa ve. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Na umono ti Kristo a hasuuha mu babaakwa ve, imiinu hya benu hili hya mu pu: benu likini hutso masumu ma benu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Buuna, babaakwa mu imiinu mu Kristo, bamiibungana. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Tso bisu laasuusa hiitu hya bisu mu Kristo, ndulu mu idiingu mo hiniihi, buuna bisu ni banga lingebe ufulala baatu boosi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ka ni mbuli, Kristo amiisuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa, na uva hiitu hya ti, boosi babaamiikwa kaka sa basuuha mu babaakwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Mu tooni ati, we bu lipfu laayidi mu muutu mumosi, bumosi kaka, tsuuhili a mu babaakwa yaayiili mu muutu mumosi. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Baatu boosi bali mu ukwa mu tooni ati, bo baabaambana na Adami. Ni bumosi kaka, baatu boosi buuyaafutaha hu moonyi bu bo babaambana na Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ka bo busuuha ilandi-ilandi: Kristo ni watsomi mu boosi, titswene ba baambana na Kristo, mu tangu yi nde huyafutaha. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Titswene, tsukusu sa yiya: Kristo sa asukasa pasi lituma, pasi matwala, pasi mifudi mi livupu, na nde sa afutala Ipfumu huli Taata Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Mu tooni ati, Kristo afwana utuma nate bu Nzambi husuusa baboho ba nde boosi hu tsina a miilu mya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Na muboho wa tsyelele wu buusukasa ni lipfu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ni mbuli, basonehe: «Nzambi asuusi bisiha byosi hu tsina a miilu mya nde.» Ka nde ubaaleele ti byosi baasuusili nde, bisu liyaabi ti, vengo Nzambi wu asuusili nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:7">Mkg 8.7</ref> </char></note> byo. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Na ŋa buusuusala nde bisiha byosi, Mwana a Muutu sa aba hu tsina lituma la Nzambi wu asuusala nde bisiha byosi. Buuna, Nzambi sa atuma we bu hwafwana mu byosi.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Tsimaani kaka mu baatu ba bali mu uyaka tondihili mu tooni a babaakwa: hima bo bali mu usaha ubaha? Tso ni mbuli ti babaakwa a bubaasuuha mu babaakwa ve, a hu li na tsoongo huli baatu mu uyaka tondihili mbuha a babaakwa ve. <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Na bisu mwakulu, mu hima libaabaani tangu yoosi bebele na lipfu? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Baana ba ngu, pasi ilumbu me umbandyenge na lipfu: mu mbuli, me ndi na nyeme mu benu mu itwadi hya na Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Me ki kaluha akiimbaha mu uyalwana na bibulu bya bwadi hu musyenge a Efeso, kini ndulu mu tooni a mambu ma imuutu? Tso babaakwa a bubaasuuha ve, ka hima bubaaleele: «Lidyaani na linywaani, mu tooni ati, ngwali bisu a benu luukwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Esa 22.13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:12">56.12</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />A liba hu iliba ve, bambaahi bababi babaabiiyasa bipfu bibibwe bya bana. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Yaafutahalaani hu matsimi mamabwe, we bu hwafwana, na kolwaani usumaha, mu tooni ati, bakima ŋa hati la benu a baayaaba Nzambi ve. Me ndi mu undele buuna mana benu likwa tsonyi.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyutu a ba baasuuha mu babaakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ka muutu sa afuula: «Buni babaakwa buusuuha mu babaakwa, na ki linyutu bo buuba na lo?» <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Muutu wu iyahudi! Ŋa we ubaakuna libutu, lo libaapanduha humbisa a hu lo limiikwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Hi we miikuna hili ndulu libutu, peleve libutu la bele, buuve libutu likima, ka a mutswihala nde mwakulu wu ubuuha ve. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Titswene, Nzambi ubaava huli libutu, nyutu yi nde atondi. Nde ubaava pasi libutu nyutu yi yafwana na lo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Bivaangu bya moonyi byosi, a bili na nyutu mosi ve. Musunya a baatu asobohono na wu banyama, bumosi kaka musunya a banyunyi asobohono na wu batswi.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Hu li na bisiha bi bibaamonehele hu yulu, na bisiha bi bibaamonehele ŋa toto. Ka bisiha bi bibaamonehele hu yulu, a bibaamwedeme bu hwasobohono na bisiha bi bibaamonehele ŋa toto. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Nyangu li na ya nde pila yi umwedeme, tsuungi kaka na ya nde pila, yi bamvwelele kaka yili kima. Tso ŋa hati li bamvwelele, pasi mvwelele ubaamwedeme na lisobosono na wuna.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Buuba bumosi mu ba baasuuha mu babaakwa. Ŋa bamiidiiha nyutu mu toto, yo yibaabolo. Ŋa yo yuusuuha mu babaakwa, yo yibaaba yi yaavelebolo. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ŋa bamiidiiha yo, yo yili yi yaatsambama, na yi yaavele mifudi. Ŋa yo yuusuuha mu babaakwa, yo yuuba yi muyusu na mifudi. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ŋa bamiidiiha mu toto, yo yili nyutu a toto, bu yo yuusuuha mu babaakwa, yo yuuba nyutu yi Livupu la Nzambi. Ni buuna, hu li na nyutu a toto, hu li kaka na nyutu a Livupu. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Mu mbuli, Mabasonehe mali mu huleele: «Muutu wa hati a tsomi, Adami, akituhi ivaangu hya moonyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Mba 2.7</ref> </char></note>.» Ka Adami wa tsyelele, aluula mu Livupu li libaava moonyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />A nyutu livupu yibaateehele ve, ka nyutu a toto. Titswene nyutu livupu yibaaya humbisa. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Adami wa hati a tsomi, baavaangi nde mu mufuundu a toto. Adami waboole amati hu mayulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Baatu ba ŋa toto baafwanina na muutu wu Nzambi haavaangi mu mufuundu a toto. Uto ti baatu ba hu yulu, bo baafwanina na muutu wu amati hu mayulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Na bu bisu lili mu ifwaani hya muutu wu Nzambi haavaangi mu mufuundu a toto, bumosi kaka bisu sa liba mu ifwaani hya muutu wu amati hu mayulu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiingili ya tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Monwaani ma me tondi uleele, baana ba ngu, nyutu yi musunya na makila utwala ubaha mukobe a Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve. Hi hibaabolo, utwala ubaambana na hi hibaavelebolo ve.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Me ndi mu unzabisa benu tswehi a Nzambi: bisu a benu a luukwa boosi ve, ka nyutu a bisu a benu boosi sa yisobo — <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mu mwana tangu hoole, we ŋa bubaapyetehe diisu. Buufula kulambeete ya tsyelele. Mu tooni ati, ŋa buufula yo, babaakwa sa basuuha na nyutu yi yukwilala, na bisu luusobo linyutu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Te 4.15-17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Mu mbuli, hwafwana ti nyutu yi yibaabolo yiniiyi, yulwata nyutu yi yibaavelebolo. Nyutu yi yibaakwa, yulwata nyutu yi yibaavelekwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Bu nyutu yi yibaabolo yiniiyi, yulwata yi yibaavelebolo, bu nyutu yi yibaakwa yulwata yi yibaavelekwa, buuna dyambu libaasonehe liniili, sa litswiha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">«Nzambi miibiingala lipfu, nde miisukasa lo!<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Lipfu, mbiingili a we ka yaayo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Lipfu, matwala ma we ma ubaaduba ka maamo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Esa 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Ose 13.14</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Lipfu ubaabaha matwala ma uduba, mu nzila lisumu, na matwala ma lisumu ubaamata mu Mikele. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ka lifutalaani matondo huli Nzambi wu ubaava bisu mbiingili mu Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba me ba litondo, hwadaani kekete, na a litsula likamba ve. Mwesaani lehemene mu isalu hya Pfumu. Mu tooni ati, benu liyaabi ti pasi yi benu lili mu umono mu isalu hya Pfumu, a yili ya mu pu ve.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bungodu mu tooni libundu la hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Libwese uleele mwana a mambu mu tooni utsonzehe bungodu, bu utsindaha huli baatu bangidi ba bali hu Yeruselemi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25-26">Lom 15.25-26</ref></char></note>: tsonzehaani bungodu we bu me apa matumili huli mabundu ma Ngalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Pasi limiingu, muutu muutu mu benu afwana uvengolo mbongo mu nzo a nde, we bu nde huutwala ubaha, mana benu livelekeele nziili a me mu utsonzehe bungodu. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ŋa me unzato, me tsatsindaha baatu ba benu luusoolo, mu ubita bungodu na mihanda mi matumili mi me upa bo, hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Tso hufwani ti me kaka nzyene, bisu a bo sa lidyenge nzila mosi.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandongi matsyelele ma Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Me unza huli benu, humbisa utaangila itaanzi hya Masedonya, mu tooni ati, me apfwana upyohele huuna. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Me utsahala huuna mu mwa matsuhu na benu, peleve mangala moosi. Buuna, benu sa likumbasa me mu usupala mudyenge a me, pasi tsyelo yi me unzyene. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Mu tooni ati, me a hatondi umono benu ndulu mutele-mutele ve. Me na matsimi ma uvyoso mwa bilumbu na benu, tso Pfumu tondi. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ka me tondi umatsahala hu musyenge a Efeso, natee ilumbu hya Pantekote. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Mu tooni ati, nzila yaamiidibuma me huuna yalala, mu usa isalu hya Nzambi, tso bu baboho bali ba balahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Mav 19.8-10</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Tso Timoteho toodi huli benu, a likolese nde binama ve, mu tooni ati, nde li mu usa isalu hya Pfumu we me. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nyaha muutu tso mumosi avelerokolo nde! Homo, kumbasaani nde mu usupala mudyenge a nde mu kinya, mana nde ayaafutahala. Me na baana ba ngu, lili mu ukeele nde. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Ka uto ti mwana a ngu a bisu Apoloosi, me umbaakwadisa nde tangu yoosi mu uya huli benu na baana ba ngu bakima. Ka nde a hamaatondo utswihasa mudyenge mo ve. Ka nde abaha tangu, nde sa aya.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Baani likanda, hwadaani mu imiinu, baani na ibahala, baani na mifudi. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Baasaani moosi na litondo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Benu liyaabi Setefano na nzo a nde: Benu liyaabi ti hu itaanzi hya Akayi, bo ni batsomi mu ukiingula buyedi, na bo bali mu ukumbasa baatu ba ngidi. Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upondo benu baana ba ngu: <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />nyahaani baatu ba pila yiina na bana boosi ba bali mu uhwada usala na bo, babaasuungaha benu.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Me ndi na kinya mu nziili a Setefano, Forfanatusi na Akayikusi. Benu alaabeedi ŋa busina ve, bo baakumbisi me ŋa mbuha a benu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Na bo baahwadisi me we bu bo baasiidi mu benu mwakulu. Yaabaani ubaasilasa baatu ba pila yiina.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Mabundu ma itaanzi hya Asiya maviidi benu mabwehe. Akilasi na Pilisile, na libundu li libaakuukama hu nzo a bo, batsindihi benu mabwehe ma litondo mu nduhi a Pfumu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Baana ba ngu boosi ba bali ŋaniiŋa, bamiiva benu mabwehe. Vanasanaani mabwehe ma ubumbasana hu litondo.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Ni mu hooho hwa me mwakulu me miitsonehe mikuma mo miniimi: mabwehe ma Pahuli.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Tso muutu a hatondo Pfumu ve, nyaha basinga nde! <char style="sc">Maranata</char>! Pfumu a bisu, yaanga!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu Yisu hiba na benu!<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Me atondo benu boosi mu itwadi hya na Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>